---
import Shell from '../layouts/Shell.astro';
---

<Shell title="Gear" description="The hardware DarkXero uses to build and test XeroLinux." current="/gear/" label="Gear" winTitle="~/gear" winSub="ls /dev/hardware">
        <div class="pane" data-tabs style="padding: max(14px, calc(2.4*var(--qh))) max(18px, 2cqw); gap: max(10px, calc(1.8*var(--qh))); font-size: max(13px, calc(1.45*var(--qh))); color: var(--text2);">
          <div style="flex: none;">
            <div class="kick" style="color: var(--accentL);">// The Setup</div>
            <h2 style="margin: 6px 0 0; font-family: 'Chakra Petch', sans-serif; font-size: 2em; line-height: 1; color: var(--text);">My Gear</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="gintro" style="flex: none; font-size: .94em;">
            <p>Some people call me an <strong style="color: var(--text);">Arch</strong> &amp; <strong style="color: var(--text);">KDE Plasma</strong> shill, and I don't see the problem with that. I use what works for me, and <strong style="color: var(--text);">Arch</strong> has been great. Sure, there are issues, but none have been deal-breakers for my use case. I've tried other distros, but <strong style="color: var(--text);">Arch</strong> is the one I can easily adapt to and fix when problems arise. Just wanted to cover these facts before moving on with the Hardware &amp; Software I use...</p>
            <p>Between here and back home in <strong style="color: var(--text);">Lebanon</strong>, I run 2 Desktops (one of which is an HTPC back home), 2 Laptops, a Mini PC, a Steam Deck, and a Raspberry Pi. Details on each below.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="gtabs" style="flex: none;">
              <button type="button" class="gt" data-tab="0" aria-pressed="true" style="color: var(--text);">
                <img src="/media/XeroMain.webp" alt="">
                <span style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 0;"><span style="font-weight: 600; font-size: .92em; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;">StationXero</span><span style="font-size: .86em; color: var(--text2); white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;">Main Rig</span></span>
              </button>
              <button type="button" class="gt" data-tab="1" aria-pressed="false" style="color: var(--text);">
                <img src="/media/XeroMini.webp" alt="">
                <span style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 0;"><span style="font-weight: 600; font-size: .92em; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;">XeroMini</span><span style="font-size: .86em; color: var(--text2); white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;">Mini Workstation</span></span>
              </button>
              <button type="button" class="gt" data-tab="2" aria-pressed="false" style="color: var(--text);">
                <img src="/media/XeroCosmic.webp" alt="">
                <span style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 0;"><span style="font-weight: 600; font-size: .92em; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;">Thinkpad T14</span><span style="font-size: .86em; color: var(--text2); white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;">Laptop</span></span>
              </button>
              <button type="button" class="gt" data-tab="3" aria-pressed="false" style="color: var(--text);">
                <img src="/media/HTPC.webp" alt="">
                <span style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 0;"><span style="font-weight: 600; font-size: .92em; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;">The HTPC</span><span style="font-size: .86em; color: var(--text2); white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;">Media Server</span></span>
              </button>
              <button type="button" class="gt" data-tab="4" aria-pressed="false" style="color: var(--text);">
                <img src="/media/Deck.webp" alt="">
                <span style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 0;"><span style="font-weight: 600; font-size: .92em; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;">Other Devices</span><span style="font-size: .86em; color: var(--text2); white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;">Deck, XPS, Pi</span></span>
              </button>
          </div>
          <div class="gwrap">
            <div class="gp" data-pane="0">
              <div class="gdet" style="gap: max(14px, 1.8cqw);">
                <button type="button" class="gzoom" data-lightbox="/media/XeroMain.webp" aria-label="Enlarge photo: StationXero desktop"><img class="gimg" src="/media/XeroMain.webp" alt="StationXero desktop"><span class="gzbadge" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m20 20-3.5-3.5M11 8v6M8 11h6"/></svg></span></button>
                <div class="gtxt">
                  <h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Chakra Petch', sans-serif; font-size: 1.6em; color: var(--text);">StationXero</h3>
                  <div class="kick" style="margin: 4px 0 12px; color: var(--accentL);">The Beast · Main Rig</div>
                  <div class="chips" style="margin-bottom: 14px;"><span class="chip" style="background: var(--soft);"><b style="color: var(--accentL);">GPU</b>RX 7800XT</span><span class="chip" style="background: var(--soft);"><b style="color: var(--accentL);">CPU</b>Ryzen 9 5950X</span><span class="chip" style="background: var(--soft);"><b style="color: var(--accentL);">RAM</b>32GB DDR4</span></div>
                  <p>Main rig, the one I do all my <em>Development</em>, <em>Gaming</em> and other things on. It has an <code>RX 7800XT</code> and a <code>Ryzen 9 5950X</code> with a whopping <code>32GB DDR4@3200Mt/s</code> RAM. I think this machine still has a few years of reliable service left in it in this economy.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="gp" data-pane="1" hidden>
              <div class="gdet" style="gap: max(14px, 1.8cqw);">
                <button type="button" class="gzoom" data-lightbox="/media/XeroMini.webp" aria-label="Enlarge photo: XeroMini PC"><img class="gimg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/media/XeroMini.webp" alt="XeroMini PC"><span class="gzbadge" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m20 20-3.5-3.5M11 8v6M8 11h6"/></svg></span></button>
                <div class="gtxt">
                  <h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Chakra Petch', sans-serif; font-size: 1.6em; color: var(--text);">XeroMini</h3>
                  <div class="kick" style="margin: 4px 0 12px; color: var(--accentL);">Mini Workstation</div>
                  <div class="chips" style="margin-bottom: 14px;"><span class="chip" style="background: var(--soft);"><b style="color: var(--accentL);">CPU</b>Ryzen 5 7530U</span><span class="chip" style="background: var(--soft);"><b style="color: var(--accentL);">RAM</b>32GB</span></div>
                  <p>This is my awesome Mini PC. It has <code>32GB RAM</code> after upgrade, with a <code>Ryzen 5 7530U</code>. That thing is not showing any signs of slowing down. It's a great little machine. It is my portable <strong style="color: var(--text);">XeroLinux</strong> project system, where I store all my files and I use it when I travel to work on the project.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="gp" data-pane="2" hidden>
              <div class="gdet" style="gap: max(14px, 1.8cqw);">
                <button type="button" class="gzoom" data-lightbox="/media/XeroCosmic.webp" aria-label="Enlarge photo: Lenovo Thinkpad T14 Gen 1"><img class="gimg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/media/XeroCosmic.webp" alt="Lenovo Thinkpad T14 Gen 1"><span class="gzbadge" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m20 20-3.5-3.5M11 8v6M8 11h6"/></svg></span></button>
                <div class="gtxt">
                  <h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Chakra Petch', sans-serif; font-size: 1.6em; color: var(--text);">Lenovo Thinkpad T14 Gen 1</h3>
                  <div class="kick" style="margin: 4px 0 12px; color: var(--accentL);">Laptop</div>
                  <div class="chips" style="margin-bottom: 14px;"><span class="chip" style="background: var(--soft);"><b style="color: var(--accentL);">CPU</b>Ryzen 5 PRO 4650U</span><span class="chip" style="background: var(--soft);"><b style="color: var(--accentL);">RAM</b>16GB</span><span class="chip" style="background: var(--soft);"><b style="color: var(--accentL);">SSD</b>1TB NVMe</span></div>
                  <p>Used in the office, with <code>1Tb nVme</code>, a <code>Ryzen 5 PRO 4650U</code>, <code>16Gb RAM</code> and an iGPU. I mainly use this thing for testing <strong style="color: var(--text);">Cosmic Epoch</strong>. I love this D.E behind KDE, I think the devs are on to something great. It will never see <strong style="color: var(--text);">Windows</strong> mark my words. It's the most <strong style="color: var(--text);">Linux</strong> friendly laptop on the market today...</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="gp" data-pane="3" hidden>
              <div class="gdet" style="gap: max(14px, 1.8cqw);">
                <button type="button" class="gzoom" data-lightbox="/media/HTPC.webp" aria-label="Enlarge photo: The HTPC"><img class="gimg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/media/HTPC.webp" alt="The HTPC"><span class="gzbadge" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m20 20-3.5-3.5M11 8v6M8 11h6"/></svg></span></button>
                <div class="gtxt">
                  <h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Chakra Petch', sans-serif; font-size: 1.6em; color: var(--text);">The HTPC</h3>
                  <div class="kick" style="margin: 4px 0 12px; color: var(--accentL);">Media Server</div>
                  <div class="chips" style="margin-bottom: 14px;"><span class="chip" style="background: var(--soft);"><b style="color: var(--accentL);">CPU</b>Core i7 6800K</span><span class="chip" style="background: var(--soft);"><b style="color: var(--accentL);">GPU</b>GTX 1080</span><span class="chip" style="background: var(--soft);"><b style="color: var(--accentL);">RAM</b>16GB</span><span class="chip" style="background: var(--soft);"><b style="color: var(--accentL);">Storage</b>~68TB</span></div>
                  <p>Has a <code>Core-i7 6800K</code>, with a <code>GTX 1080</code> GPU, and <code>16GB RAM</code>. Being my HTPC, it has 14 Drives of various sizes totalling <code>~68TB</code> of storage. The only app installed on that thing is <a href="https://jellyfin.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--accentL);">Jellyfin</a> as a <em>Flatpak</em>. It's currently running <strong style="color: var(--text);">XeroLinux</strong>.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="gp" data-pane="4" hidden>
              <div class="gdet" style="gap: max(14px, 1.8cqw);">
                <button type="button" class="gzoom" data-lightbox="/media/Deck.webp" aria-label="Enlarge photo: Steam Deck"><img class="gimg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/media/Deck.webp" alt="Steam Deck" style="aspect-ratio: 1088 / 483;"><span class="gzbadge" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m20 20-3.5-3.5M11 8v6M8 11h6"/></svg></span></button>
                <div class="gtxt">
                  <h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Chakra Petch', sans-serif; font-size: 1.6em; color: var(--text);">Other Random Devices</h3>
                  <div class="kick" style="margin: 4px 0 12px; color: var(--accentL);">Portable Workstation &amp; More</div>
                  <div class="chips" style="margin-bottom: 14px;"><span class="chip" style="background: var(--soft);">Steam Deck</span><span class="chip" style="background: var(--soft);">Dell XPS 13</span><span class="chip" style="background: var(--soft);">Raspberry Pi 4</span></div>
                  <p>A <strong style="color: var(--text);">Steam Deck</strong> which used to be my retro gaming console, but repurposed as portable Workstation with <strong style="color: var(--text);">XeroLinux</strong> installed on it. It's the perfect little compact on the go tool that just sits there quietly doing its thing.</p>
                  <p>And last but not least, an old-ass <strong style="color: var(--text);">Dell-XPS</strong>, 13' Capacitive 4K Touch screen, with an <code>Intel Core i7 7600</code> and <code>16GB RAM</code>. That thing sits around, maybe try a few Distros on it every now and then.</p>
                  <p>And as an honorable mention, a <strong style="color: var(--text);">Raspberry Pi 4</strong> <code>4GB</code> that is gathering dust as with many of my other unused devices. Maybe one day will find a good use for it lol.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="fleet" aria-label="The fleet">
            <div class="ftile" style="--fc: var(--c1L);"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="12" rx="2"/><path d="M8 20h8M12 16v4"/></svg><div><div class="big">2</div><div class="kick">Desktops</div></div></div>
            <div class="ftile" style="--fc: var(--c2L);"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="5" width="16" height="11" rx="1.5"/><path d="M2 19h20"/></svg><div><div class="big">2</div><div class="kick">Laptops</div></div></div>
            <div class="ftile" style="--fc: var(--c3L);"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="8" width="16" height="9" rx="2"/><path d="M8 13h.01M11 13h5"/></svg><div><div class="big">1</div><div class="kick">Mini PC</div></div></div>
            <div class="ftile" style="--fc: var(--c1L);"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="10" rx="5"/><path d="M7 10v4M5 12h4M16.5 11h.01M18.5 13h.01"/></svg><div><div class="big">1</div><div class="kick">Steam Deck</div></div></div>
            <div class="ftile" style="--fc: var(--c2L);"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="5" width="14" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M9 2v3M15 2v3M9 19v3M15 19v3M2 9h3M2 15h3M19 9h3M19 15h3"/><rect x="9" y="9" width="6" height="6" rx="1"/></svg><div><div class="big">1</div><div class="kick">Raspberry Pi</div></div></div>
            <div class="ftile" style="--fc: var(--c3L);"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><ellipse cx="12" cy="6" rx="8" ry="3"/><path d="M4 6v6c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3V6M4 12v6c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3v-6"/></svg><div><div class="big">~68TB</div><div class="kick">Storage</div></div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      
</Shell>
